---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="A little about me.">
  <header class="hero">
    <h1>About</h1>
  </header>

  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      I am a designer and developer. I care about interfaces that
      feel <strong>physical</strong> — things that respond when you press them
      and sit where you expect them to.
    </p>
    <p>
      Most of my work sits somewhere between design and engineering. I like
      building the whole thing: the system, the components, and the last five
      percent of polish that nobody asks for but everybody notices.
    </p>
    <p>
      Outside of work I am usually looking up. Astronomy got me into this in the
      first place — the idea that you can describe something enormous with a
      small, clean set of rules.
    </p>
    <p>I am based in the UK and open to interesting work.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
